  "description": {
   "en": "Endou Madoka has always dreamed of becoming a manga artist, but repeated failures have left him stuck in a rut.\n\nOne night, after drinking himself into oblivion, he wakes up in a love hotel—only to find himself face-to-face with a mysterious, stunning girl named Yosuga Rankawa.\n\nBefore he knows it, he’s showing her his manuscript, heart pounding as she lounges before him in nothing but her underwear. Her verdict? The story is trash, but the art is decent.\n\nWith Yosuga’s relentless persuasion, the two form an unlikely duo, setting their sights on the world of erotic manga!\n\nThus begins the passionate ero-manga journey of a washed-up middle-aged man and a genius beauty!",
   "ja": "漫画家を夢見るも挫折続きの遠藤円と、彼の前に突如現れた謎の美少女、蘭川よすが。\n酒で酔いつぶれていた遠藤は気付かぬうちにラブホテルに連れて行かれ、下着姿のよすがにドキドキしながらなぜか原稿を見せるハメに。\nストーリーはクソだが絵はいいと評価された遠藤は、よすがの強引な勧誘により、2人で組んでエロ漫画家をめざすことに‥‥！？\n\n冴えない中年男と天才美少女の熱血エロ漫画ライフが始まる！！"
  },
